    <content>
      <![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">
<en-note><div>Niamh's wedding, Sat July 11. RSVP by June 15.</div><div><br/></div><div>Flights (looked 6/7)</div><ul><li>ROA -&gt; IAD -&gt; DUB Wed 7/8 overnight, land Thu 7/9 morning</li><li>back Tue 7/14 (Mon was $180 more)</li><li>~$870 economy with a bag. via BOS: cheaper but 2 stops on return</li></ul><div><br/></div><div>Hotel: family block near the venue, rate in Niamh's email. Need to book by 6/25. Thu–Sat at the block, Sun–Mon with the cousins in Drumcondra.</div><div>Dress code: smart / summer suit.</div><div><br/></div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>RSVP sent 6/9 (yes, 1 guest = just me)</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>book flight (6/14)</div><div><en-todo checked="false"/>book hotel</div><div><en-todo checked="false"/>gift from the registry</div><div><br/></div><div>7/2 update: hotel booked (3 nights). Gift: the Irish linen set off the registry, $120, shipped to Niamh's. Bring laptop, NeurIPS rebuttal lands right after I'm back (7/24-ish), so Mon 7/13 = work day at the cousins'. Leave paperwork can wait until 7/15.</div></en-note>]]>
    </content>
  </note>
</en-export>
